   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "CAMERA MOTION\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 1, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Frequency of angle changes\n   2 Hold\n   3 Camera carry\n   4 Camera move\n   5 Move speed\n   6 Move follows\n   7 Move starts on\n   8 Camera owner\n   9 Move against loudness\n  10 Shake\n  11 Time speed\n  12 suite: Handheld hunt\n  13 suite: Smooth push\n  14 suite: Object insert\n  15 suite: Loving camera\n  16 suite: Aggressive camera\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 1, CC 65 to 74\n   1 suite: Follows the voice\n   2 suite: Video game camera\n   3 pair: When the camera goes handheld, gesture grows\n   4 pair: When the player takes the camera, the view becomes theirs\n   5 pair: When a character crosses the room, the camera move starts with them\n   6 pair: When the camera follows a character, it tracks alongside them\n   7 pair: When the camera moves on a breath, a small pause opens up\n   8 pair: When the camera jumps on loud moments, the shot gets shakier\n   9 pairs: The camera answers the body\n  10 pairs: Camera moves with a reason"
   },
   "pos": [
